    },
    "priority": 400,
    "weight": 1
  },
  "presentation": {
    "location": "存在しない地下階",
    "assets": [
      {
        "id": "cassim-bell.power.asset.background.001",
        "kind": "background",
        "path": "/assets/story/bg-observation-deck-night.png",
        "alt": "存在しない地下階の背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "cassim-bell.power.asset.still.001",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/cassim-bell-power.png",
        "alt": "手をつないだまま扉の向こうを確かめる瞬間"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.power.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "エレベーターに、無い階のボタンがあった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "カシムさんが鍵飾りをかざすと、盤面に「地下∞」が浮かぶ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「今から行くのは、存在しない地下階です。台帳にも、設計図にも、載っていません」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "降りた先は、長い長い廊下だった。左右に扉が七枚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "どれも意匠が違う。竜の鱗の扉、月光の扉、海藻の絡んだ扉——七世界の、扉。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "落とし物は、物だけではありません。……道も、落ちるのです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "持ち主の世界が終わった時に。ここは、行き場のなくなった扉の保管庫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "終わった物語の、玄関だけが並ぶ廊下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ノブの一つずつが、まだ磨かれてる。誰も来ないのに、彼が磨いてきた。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "この廊下では、私から離れないでください。……手を離すと、昨日の廊下に出ます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "き、昨日!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "黒手袋の手が、私の手を取った。丁寧で迷いのない、受付のプロの手つき。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "心拍は、事務処理してくれない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "廊下の照明が、二人の歩幅に合わせて灯っていく。耳が、静かに忙しい。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "次の相手は、退路を断つ戦法を使うそうですね。……ならば、こちらは退路を「作る」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "側に回ります。見ていてください。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "flash"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼が鍵を回すと、廊下の空間そのものが、めくれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "扉が、どこにでも「受付」される。壁に、床に、空中に。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "出口が咲いていく。閉じた空間は、この人の前ではただの未処理案件だった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今夜も同行してた計測係の新人くんは、扉の一枚から「三分前の廊下」に出た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三分後の自分と鉢合わせて、記録板に「ふたり、いた。」と書いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼の報告書は、もはや怪談だった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "そして、これが本題です。——七枚のうち、一枚だけ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "今夜、開けようと思っている扉があります。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「私が最初に受付した、失われた世界の扉です。……開けるのが、ずっと怖かった」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「中の世界が本当に終わってるのを、確かめてしまうから」",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……手、つないだままでいいなら。一緒に確かめます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.power.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "扉の向こうは、夕暮れの野原だった。誰もいない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.014b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.014b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "でも、風は吹いていて、遠くで洗濯物が揺れていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.014c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.014c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "終わった世界は、空っぽじゃなかった。ただ、静かなだけだった。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.015a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.015a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……終わっても、風は吹くのですね。……受付票に、追記します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.015b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.015b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "「当該世界、風あり。継続保管の価値、大いにあり」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.016a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.016a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "扉を閉めて、鍵をかけて、彼は長い息を吐いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.line.016b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.power.line.016b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "次の試合の型は、もう決まったようなもの。あとは、どちらの形で仕上げるか。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "cassim-bell.power.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cassim-bell.power.choice.001",
          "label": "失われた世界へ続く扉を、一枚だけ開ける",
          "result": "試合の型は「非常口」になった。味方が追い詰められると、カシムさんの扉が空間に咲き退路と再配置を同時に作る。実況が「出口が、出口が増えていく！」相手は退路を断つ戦法を捨てた",
          "intent": "退路を作る側の強さを形にする",
          "promise": "失敗時の危険を引き受け、この人専用の成長を最大まで進める。",
          "memory": "型「非常口」の初披露を、実況席まで覚えている。",
          "tone": "heroic",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "cassim-bell"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 10,
              "ownership": -4
            },
            {
              "type": "fighterPoints",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "cassim-bell"
              },
              "amount": 5
            }
          ],
          "goto": "cassim-bell.power.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "cassim-bell.power.choice.002",
          "label": "敵の大技だけを遺失物として保管する",
          "result": "もう一つの型は「お預かり」敵の大技を扉一枚で受付し、遺失物として一時保管、返却は試合終了後。相手は必殺技に「保管番号」を発行され戦意を半分落とした。新人くんの記録は「わざ、あずかった」",
          "intent": "受付の書式で、戦場を管理する",
          "promise": "本来の力は一部に留め、チーム全体の成長へ成果を持ち帰る。",
          "memory": "保管番号を発行された相手の顔を、チームは忘れられない。",
          "tone": "pragmatic",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
